   "text": "Provisional investment declarations are made in April. Final investment proofs (for example, rent receipts for HRA, Section 80C investments, home loan interest certificates) must be uploaded in the Payroll portal between 1 January and 31 January. Proofs not submitted by 31 January will not be considered, and tax will be recalculated and deducted from the February and March salaries. This is the main reason for the March query peak. Proof type: HRA; What to upload: Rent receipts and landlord PAN if annual rent is above Rs 1,00,000; Deadline: 31 January. Proof type: Section 80C; What to upload: Investment statements (PPF, ELSS, LIC premium receipts); Deadline: 31 January. Proof type: Home loan interest; What to upload: Lender's provisional interest certificate; Deadline: 31 January. Proof type: Section 80D (health insurance); What to upload: Premium receipts for self, family or parents; Deadline: 31 January",
