   "text": "You are automatically enrolled in the company Group Personal Pension plan. The company contributes 5% of basic salary when you contribute at least 3%. If you increase your contribution, the company matches up to a maximum company contribution of 8% of basic salary. Contributions are made through salary sacrifice unless you opt out of salary sacrifice. You can change your contribution in the Benefits portal at any time.",
