   "text": "This policy applies to employees of Brightpath Technologies UK Ltd. It does not form part of your contract of employment and may be changed by the company. Where your contract of employment says something different, your contract applies. Contractors and agency workers should refer to the terms of their engagement (GLB-CONTRACTOR). The holiday year runs from 1 January to 31 December.",
