   "section": "2",
   "section_title": "PTO accrual",
   "text": "Full-time employees accrue paid time off (PTO) each pay period based on years of service: Years of service: Less than 3 years; PTO per year: 15 days (120 hours); Accrual per biweekly pay period: 4.62 hours. Years of service: 3 to 7 years; PTO per year: 20 days (160 hours); Accrual per biweekly pay period: 6.15 hours. Years of service: More than 7 years; PTO per year: 25 days (200 hours); Accrual per biweekly pay period: 7.69 hours",
   "prose": "Full-time employees accrue paid time off (PTO) each pay period based on years of service:",
