   "section_title": "PTO carryover",
   "text": "You can carry over up to 40 hours (5 days) of unused PTO into the next calendar year. Any balance above 40 hours on 31 December is forfeited, except where state law requires otherwise (for example, in California accrued PTO is not forfeited and accrual stops at a cap of 1.5 times the annual entitlement).",
